# Optional app settings for the Lightsail host. Copy to
# /opt/authority-records/app.env on the server and edit; deploys never
# overwrite it. Changes apply on the next `docker compose up -d`.
#
# Any ASP.NET Core setting can be set here: use __ for nested keys (the
# equivalent of the old Azure App Service "Application settings").

# First Super user on a fresh database. Created once on startup if no Super
# user exists yet (also creates the standard roles). Remove both lines after
# signing in; they are ignored once a Super user exists.
# Password: 8+ chars with upper, lower, digit and symbol. Single quotes keep
# the value literal (a bare $ would be treated as a variable).
# Bootstrap__SuperUserEmail='you@example.com'
# Bootstrap__SuperUserPassword='Change-Me-1!'

# Public demo account (default: enabled)
# Demo__Enabled=true
# Demo__LoginEmail=demo@example.com
# Demo__RateLimit__MaxCreatesPerWindow=30
# Demo__RateLimit__WindowMinutes=60
# Demo__RateLimit__MaxBytesPerWrite=65536

# Logging
# Logging__LogLevel__Default=Warning
